The local first cycle and outgoing slopes are
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{ccc}\toprule
Primitive direction&First divisor weight&Outgoing slope\\\midrule
$(1,1)$&$2A+B$&$B$\\
$(-1,-1)$&$2S$&$0$\\
$(1,0)$&$B$&$S$\\
$(0,1)$&$B$&$S$\\\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
